__d(function(e,t,a,o,r,n,s){r.exports={title:"Vastu Grid Privacy Policy",updated:"17 October 2026",developer:"Sambhav24",contactEmail:"sambhav242005@gmail.com",supportEmail:"sambhav242005@gmail.com",publicUrl:"https://gist.github.com/Sambhav242005/8175d71f95f93c238390a2eb112cd95e",sections:[{heading:"Offline Kundli and birth details",text:"Kundli calculations run offline. Each Kundli project contains one person's birth details and chart, separate from Vastu projects. Names, birth dates, birth times, birthplaces and unfinished form inputs save automatically on this device. Clear birth details inside a Kundli project, or delete that project in Projects. Device backup services may retain app data under your device settings. Kundli data is not included in Vastu exports."},{heading:"Your projects stay on your device",text:"This mobile release has no account, cloud sync, ads, analytics, purchases or AI service. Named Vastu and Kundli projects are stored separately on your device and save automatically. Plot measurements, client notes, observations, selected plan images and preferences are not uploaded to our servers. Protect access to your device and exported files."},{heading:"Optional location and images",text:"Location is requested only when you choose a GPS/location action. Coordinates and the north reference are used for your site and may be saved in the project. There is no background location tracking. You can deny location and enter measurements manually. The system photo picker gives access to images you select; a local copy is kept for your plan overlay."},{heading:"Optional online maps and search",text:"Opening the site map loads Leaflet resources from unpkg.com and street map tiles from OpenStreetMap. Selecting Satellite requests imagery from Esri ArcGIS World Imagery. Tile requests reveal the viewed area, which may be your site location, together with your IP address and network/browser information. Submitted address searches are sent to Photon at photon.komoot.io. These providers process requests under their own policies. Project names, notes and plan images are not sent to them. Manual planning and exports do not require maps or search."},{heading:"Exports and support",text:"DXF, PDF and summary exports can include project information and coordinates. Files are shared only through the destination you choose in Android. Opening support, policy or provider links contacts the chosen website or email app; information you send to support is used to respond to your request."},{heading:"Retention and deletion",text:"Delete saved projects in Projects. The current draft, images and preferences can remain in app storage; clear Vastu Grid storage in Android Settings to remove all local app data. Uninstalling removes local app storage, but separately exported files and data retained by your device backup service must be deleted there. Map/search providers control their own request-log retention. The mobile app has no account to delete."}]}},3047,[]);
